<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs034" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Inputs converging on one result as a native prompted diagram beside a text cell: working title and one sentence on the left, the diagram on the right in a 23/37 split.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="23" vertical-align="center" id="CYxRJx5N-6"><h2>What sets the delivery schedule</h2><p>Each input is refreshed before the routes are fixed for the quarter, because one stale input spoils the whole schedule.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="37" vertical-align="center" align="center" id="y3ijMb-vz6"><diagram data-meta="{&quot;general&quot;:[{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Delivery plan</h4>&quot;}],&quot;step&quot;:[{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Sales forecasts</h4><p>Regional managers' view</p>&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Warehouse capacity</h4><p>After the second shift returns</p>&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Supplier lead times</h4><p>Top twenty items</p>&quot;}]}" height="340pt" width="520pt" align="center" template-key="inputs"></diagram></grid-item></grid></section>